  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 120 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E12", "E13"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The fondaparinux sodium products at all three Corvale sites share the same NDC 11797015609 and labeler Italfarmaco S.p.A., linking them to the same registered manufacturing plants.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "One registered plant for this NDC is ScinoPharm Taiwan, Ltd. (FEI 3002840477), which FDA inspected on 2026-06-23 and classified OAI with seven observations including sterile procedures and validation deficiencies.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's record shows the OAI classification was known on 2026-09-21, which is 120 days before today's posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The other registered plant, Italfarmaco S.p.A. (FEI 1196), received a VAI classification on its most recent inspection ending 2023-06-28.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has only 7 days of supply on hand while Corvale General holds 31 days, creating an imbalance across the system.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 79 units from Corvale General to Corvale East would leave General with 14 days on hand and bring East to 14 days, balancing coverage at two weeks each.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
